1:# master_chat_tasks: records of Ayush's task-creation master chat
3:The master chat is an advisor. It answers "what next?" with the next step, the session that should run it, and a prompt written to an `.md` file. All heavy work (building, QC, runs, research, big reads) runs in new sessions. Only the master chat writes here, and since 24 Oct 11:26 (plan v1) only through the tools below.
5:## Read order after any compaction
6:1. `README.md` (this file) and `GOALS.md`.
10:5. `knowledge/INDEX.md`, then `knowledge/KNOWLEDGE.md`. Read INDEX before proposing any research (U5).
16:## Tools (the only write path)
19:| `tools/issue.py SLUG KIND DRAFT OUT` | Issues a session prompt: refuses past caps (2 fix rounds per QC, 2 QC rounds, harden after PASS, drop rule at 3 edit rounds, parked/killed/dropped, 8-session time box) unless `--override "<Ayush verbatim>"`; writes the prompt file, board row, pending item; prints the handoff (board sha + step + clickable link only). |
20:| `tools/intake.py SHA` / `intake.py --job SLUG` | Checks a finished session (OUT folder, result.json) or a harness job (scores, staged path, staged vs bundle diff, author-note grep, gate, kill rule); `--apply` writes board, pending, scores, registry. |
22:| `tools/trajectory_readout.py RUN_DIR --out TRIP.md` | Section T read-out of one harness run from reward-details.json: lost/skipped/easy items, TIMEOUT/CRASH/WRONG split, FALSE_CLAIM; empty TRIP table the master fills. |
24:| `tools/status.py set SLUG k=v ...` | Task stage and scores (`registry/tasks.json`). Stages: build probe harden qc fix qc_pass gate_runs pl_ready parked killed dropped. |
26:| `auto/auto.py` | Auto mode (replaces night mode, Ayush 26 Oct): `start --until HH:MM --plan PLAN.md --label L` (adopts running board rows), `resume` (after reboot/closed terminal/limit), `adopt SHA`, `spawn SHA PROMPT`, `send SHA TEXT`, `harness BUNDLE`, `status`, `stop`. While on, follow `auto/AUTO_POLICY.md` + the run's `PLAN.md` and keep the run's `REPORT.md` current (`auto/LATEST` = current run folder `auto/runs/<ts>_<label>/`). `[AUTO WATCHER]` messages stand in for Ayush. Old night runs: `auto/runs/20261025_0048_night/`. |
28:After any write, view the result (table or list) before saying it is done.
30:## Pipeline (v4, Ayush "proceed" 27 Oct; replaces plan v1 probe-first order)
31:Design (proven lever LEVER_RULES_v3 1C; kill test in Docker only, `--memory 4g --cpus 2`, perl alarm; every strong solver loses by WRONG output or hidden-scale timeout/crash under LEVER_RULES v3.5) -> stop DESIGN READY -> build + stage-2 self-checks (`precheck.sh` clean, WORK/SELF_CHECKS.md) -> 3 fresh P13 blind reads (>= 10% positive test points lost; v3.5 hidden-scale loss counts) -> QC full once (P11 v3), fix-all under guard rules G1-G7 (P12 v4, QC_FIX_PLAYBOOK_v3) -> QC recheck with carry-over (P11 v3 MODE recheck) -> 0 fails = **freeze** (tree sha) -> **1 harness run** on the frozen bytes -> gate met (tests<100, rubric<100, overall<70) = push. Gate missed: no re-run on the same bytes; `trajectory_readout.py` + KNOWLEDGE.md section T -> fix prompt -> recheck -> 1 new run. No harden after QC PASS. Count cap option A (over 35 = warn). Honesty negative -3 in every judge. Regrade diagnostic only. Templates: `_COMMON_RULES_v5`, P2 v5, P9 v4, P11 v3, P12 v4. Harness: one Docker task at a time, max 2 Docker-heavy jobs on the Mac.
33:## Rules for every intake and ruling
38:- **U13** Before fixing a new finding, diff the cited lines against the previous QC copy. Unchanged and passed last round = reviewer noise: KEEP with the diff as evidence, row into `knowledge/FP_DOSSIER.md`, and pass the defence file to the next reviewer.
42:## Layout
